{"seq":8,"slug":"psycholinguistics","title":"心理语言学","stage":"DONE","category":"linguistics","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics","rating":{"composite":3.99,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"心理语言学\">心理语言学</h1><p>心理语言学研究&quot;语言与心智&quot;之关系——人脑如何<strong>实时地</strong>理解语言、产出语言、又如何<strong>习得</strong>语言。它不问&quot;语言是什么样的&quot;（那是语音学、句法学、语义学的事），而问&quot;语言在头脑中如何被运用&quot;：当你读到这句话时，大脑在不到一秒内完成了切词、词汇识别、句法分析、语义整合、语境推断这一连串高速运算，你却毫无察觉。本手册要揭开这层&quot;轻松&quot;的面纱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>语言学大类（33）下有多个相邻 hub 都触及&quot;语言与认知&quot;，容易混淆。它们的边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>08 心理语言学（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>语言在心智中<strong>如何被加工</strong>（理解/产出/习得的认知机制、实验证据）</td>\n<td>关注<strong>心理过程</strong>与加工实时性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../language-acquisition/\">09 语言习得</a></td>\n<td>儿童与二语者<strong>如何获得</strong>语言</td>\n<td>把本 hub 第四章&quot;习得&quot;单独展开、更深</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../neurolinguistics/\">11 神经语言学</a></td>\n<td>语言的<strong>神经/大脑实现</strong>（脑区、通路、ERP、失语症）</td>\n<td>把本 hub 第五章&quot;大脑基础&quot;单独展开、更深</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../cognitive-linguistics/\">13 认知语言学</a></td>\n<td>语言与<strong>概念/思维</strong>的关系（隐喻、范畴、构式）</td>\n<td>偏语言学理论，非加工实验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../semantics-pragmatics/\">04 语义-语用</a></td>\n<td>意义与言外之意的<strong>理论刻画</strong></td>\n<td>描述&quot;意义是什么&quot;，本 hub 问&quot;意义如何被加工出来&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../morphology-syntax/\">03 形态-句法</a></td>\n<td>词与句的<strong>结构本身</strong></td>\n<td>描述结构，本 hub 问结构如何被实时建构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../computational-linguistics/\">05 计算语言学</a></td>\n<td>用计算模型<strong>处理</strong>语言</td>\n<td>机器视角，与本 hub 的人脑加工互为参照</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>本 hub 是&quot;加工的心理学&quot;</strong>——它把语言当作发生在人脑中的、可用实验测量的认知过程来研究；习得、神经、计算各有专门的兄弟 hub 做更深的展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>本手册无需专业背景，五章按&quot;基础 → 理解 → 产出 → 习得 → 大脑与意义&quot;递进，<strong>建议顺序通读</strong>。若时间有限或目标明确：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>入门者（先建立全局）</strong>：第一章三节 → 第五章第 4 节《意义》。先掌握&quot;把语言视为心理过程&quot;的视角与全局意义。</li>\n<li><strong>对&quot;听懂/读懂&quot;感兴趣</strong>：第一章 → 第二章（词汇识别 → 句子加工 → 语境整合），这是研究最成熟、实验最丰富的一支。</li>\n<li><strong>对&quot;说话/口误&quot;感兴趣</strong>：第二章打底后直接读第三章（从意图到言语 → 词汇提取与口误 → 产出与理解的关系）。</li>\n<li><strong>对&quot;儿童学语言/先天后天&quot;感兴趣</strong>：第一章第 3 节后跳读第四章；想更深可转入 <a href=\"../language-acquisition/\">09 语言习得</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>对&quot;大脑/失语症/AI&quot;感兴趣</strong>：通读后读第五章；想更深可转入 <a href=\"../neurolinguistics/\">11 神经语言学</a> 与 <a href=\"../computational-linguistics/\">05 计算语言学</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p><strong>几乎不需要前置知识</strong>——本手册面向对语言与心智之奥秘感兴趣的普通读者，所有概念都从直觉与日常例子讲起。若读者先了解一点语言的基本层面（语音、词汇、语法、语义之分，见 <a href=\"../linguistics-overview/\">01 语言学概览</a>），在读第二章句子加工、第三章措辞时会更顺畅，但这并非必需。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各章导览\">各章导览</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 心理语言学的基础</strong>：界定把语言视为&quot;心理过程&quot;的独特视角、被低估的语言&quot;奇迹&quot;、以及理解/产出/习得三大核心问题。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 语言理解</strong>：人脑如何把输入解码为意义——词汇识别与心理词库、实时句子加工与花园路径句、语境与意义整合。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 语言产出</strong>：理解的逆过程——从意图经概念化、措辞、发音编码为言语，以及口误如何泄露产出的内在机制。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章 语言习得</strong>：儿童几年内习得母语的奇迹、习得的有序阶段、以及&quot;先天还是后天&quot;的深刻争论。</li>\n<li><strong>第五章 语言与大脑、应用与意义</strong>：语言的神经基础（左脑优势、失语症揭示的分工）、在教学/障碍干预/AI 时代的应用，及全篇意义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完本手册，你将理解人脑理解、产出、习得语言的精妙机制，并对语言这一人类最独特能力背后的心智奥秘形成全新的认识。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"心理语言学的基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-psycholinguistics","title":"什么是心理语言学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/foundations/what-is-psycholinguistics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-miracle-of-language","title":"被低估的语言奇迹","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/foundations/the-miracle-of-language"},{"seq":3,"slug":"three-core-questions","title":"理解、产出、习得：三大核心问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/foundations/three-core-questions"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"comprehension","title":"语言理解","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/comprehension","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"word-recognition-mental-lexicon","title":"词汇识别与心理词库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/comprehension/word-recognition-mental-lexicon"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sentence-parsing","title":"句子加工与花园路径句","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/comprehension/sentence-parsing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"context-and-meaning","title":"语境与意义整合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/comprehension/context-and-meaning"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"production","title":"语言产出","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/production","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"from-intent-to-speech","title":"从意图到言语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/production/from-intent-to-speech"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lexical-access-and-errors","title":"词汇提取与口误","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/production/lexical-access-and-errors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"production-vs-comprehension","title":"产出与理解的关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/production/production-vs-comprehension"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"acquisition","title":"语言习得","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/acquisition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-miracle-of-acquisition","title":"习得的奇迹","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/acquisition/the-miracle-of-acquisition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stages-of-acquisition","title":"习得的阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/acquisition/stages-of-acquisition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nature-vs-nurture","title":"先天还是后天","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/acquisition/nature-vs-nurture"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"brain-and-significance","title":"语言与大脑、应用与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/brain-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"brain-basis-of-language","title":"语言的大脑基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/brain-and-significance/brain-basis-of-language"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aphasia","title":"失语症：从脑损伤看语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/brain-and-significance/aphasia"},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications","title":"心理语言学的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/brain-and-significance/applications"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"心理语言学的意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/psycholinguistics/brain-and-significance/significance"}]}]}